msgstr "Social"

#: includes/admin.php:74
msgid ""
"Publicación social autónoma. Conexiones, formatos y calendario sin campañas,"
" ofertas ni reglas especiales de Noticias."
msgstr "Independent social publishing. Connections, formats and calendar without marketing campaigns, offers or special News rules."

#: includes/admin.php:77 includes/core.php:2718
msgid "Redes sociales"
msgstr "Social networks"

#: includes/admin.php:77
msgid ""
"El calendario es la única agenda de este módulo. Las publicaciones se "
"programan aquí y utilizan las plantillas de cada red."
msgstr "The calendar is this module's only schedule. Posts are scheduled here using each network's templates."

#: includes/admin.php:109
msgid "Agenda social"
msgstr "Social calendar"

#: includes/admin.php:109
msgid ""
"Programa publicaciones manualmente o por CSV y revisa el resultado en el "
"calendario mensual. No se incorporan campañas de Marketing ni se reserva "
"ninguna franja para Noticias."
msgstr "Schedule posts manually or via CSV and review the results in the monthly calendar. Marketing campaigns and special News timeslots are not included."

#: includes/admin.php:109
msgid "Solo redes sociales"
msgstr "Social networks only"

#: includes/calendar.php:242
msgid "Calendario de publicaciones"
msgstr "Publishing calendar"

#: includes/calendar.php:242
