msgstr "TaxoCommerce Social Auto Test"

#: includes/class-auto-test.php:265
msgid ""
"Chequeo local de solo lectura de conexiones registradas, plantillas, tablas,"
" calendario y programador. No conecta cuentas ni publica. Se guardan los dos"
" últimos resultados por administrador durante 30 días."
msgstr "Read-only local checks of registered connections, templates, tables, calendar and scheduler. No accounts are connected and nothing is published. The last two results per administrator are saved for 30 days."

#: includes/class-auto-test.php:271
msgid "No existen resultados todavía. Pulsa Ejecutar Auto Test."
msgstr "No results yet. Click Run Auto Test."

